{
  "about": "The blocks of a bot's chat (#625, #627), as public/unread.js (Unread.blocks) and the Android app (ChatOrder.rounds) draw them. A run with replyTo is a round of the block of the run it replied to, followed to the first run of the chain that is in the chat; else a block of its own. A block stands where the reply of its last round stands (chat-order.json). blocks: each block's runs, oldest first.",
